      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا أَضْحَلَ خَيْرَكَ</span></b>  means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا أَقَلَّهُ</span> [i. e. (assumed tropical:)  <i>How
little,</i> or <i>scanty, is thy goodness,</i> or <i>bounty,</i> or
<i>beneficence!</i>]. (TA.)

